# Cloudflare-only configuration.
#
# GitHub Pages does not support custom headers and ignores this file completely,
# so these rules apply ONLY to the Cloudflare deployment (cf.fanowu.com and the
# *.workers.dev URLs) — never to the live public site at https://fanowu.com.
#
# Purpose: cf.fanowu.com is a duplicate staging/test copy of the real site. This
# keeps it out of Google and other search engines so it can never compete with,
# or be mistaken for, the real site.
#
# NOTE: deliberately NOT done via robots.txt "Disallow". Blocking a crawler stops
# it reading the page, so it never sees a noindex instruction — and a blocked URL
# can still get indexed from inbound links. X-Robots-Tag is the correct tool.
/*
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex, nofollow
